What is Edge Delivery Services (EDS)?

Adobe Edge Delivery Services is a modern way to build and deliver websites that focuses on:

Fast page loading
Simpler content authoring
Better SEO
Easy content management
Delivery through Adobe's edge network

Instead of heavy, complex AEM components, EDS allows content creators to manage content using familiar tools like:

Microsoft Word
Google Docs
SharePoint
AEM Universal Editor

and publish it directly to websites.

Traditional Flow---
Author
   ↓
AEM Author
   ↓
AEM Publish
   ↓
Dispatcher/CDN
   ↓
Website

EDS Flow----
Author (Word/Docs/AEM)
          ↓
Edge Delivery Services
          ↓
    CDN / Edge
          ↓
      Website

